<title>UK: Securicor says losses to continue in SCS.</title>
<headline>Securicor says losses to continue in SCS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified security group Securicor Group Plc said on Thursday it expects losses will continue to be incurred in its Securicor Cellular Services (SCS) division.</p>
<p>In March, the group warned that its communications division was likely to record operating losses of around nine million stg in the six months to March 31, 1997.</p>
